OL,3,AG7 leaders to meet over diesel supplies
OL,4,Aas RAC says UK prices hit #2 a litre
OL,5,Afor first time
OL,6,
OL,7,FG7 leaders are meeting by video
OL,8,Fconference to discuss the situation -
OL,9,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband will
OL,10,Fattend for the UK
OL,12,FUK Transport Minister Keir Mather says
OL,13,Fthe UK's supply of diesel is "robust"
OL,14,Fand "resilient" and the country has a
OL,15,Fwide range of sources
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
