OL,3,A'Ashamed': Cornell students gather to
OL,4,Avoice anger over alleged gang rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Thursday's assembly, some labelled
OL,7,Fthe perceived lack of justice a
OL,8,F"disgrace" and criticised the
OL,9,Fprestigious university, which has
OL,10,Fdefended its handling of the case.
OL,12,F"We deserve to know that our
OL,13,Finstitution values our safety more than
OL,14,Fits reputation," undergraduate Sophia
OL,15,FRiley Sim told those at the gathering.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
